WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.110
 What's up, Marvel fans.

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:03.720
We're here with J.K. Simmons,
who plays Jay Jonah Jameson.

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:07.470
What was it like to come
back for the Spider-Man film?

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:10.650
 Always a pleasure,
whatever incarnation.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:13.950
I hope they keep
reincarnating JJJ.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.230
 Now what's the difference
between this Jay Jonah Jameson

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:17.640
and the one you
played previously?

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:20.160
 Only the hair, really.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.110
 So this film is so massive.

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:24.840
What was it like working with
this incredible ensemble?

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:26.790
 Well, I'll tell
you I was in and out.

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:30.310
I still haven't met 2/3
of the cast of this movie.

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:32.280
I'm hoping I get that
opportunity tonight.

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.200
 So who are you
excited to see tonight?

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.490
 That kid to play Spider-Man
whatever, his name is,

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:43.200
and you know the 75 bad guys,
some of whom are old leftovers

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.847
like myself, and some new ones.

00:00:44.847 --> 00:00:46.080
 Throughout your
Spider-Man journey,

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:47.910
do you have a favorite moment?

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:48.730
 Can't pick one.

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:51.050
Not going to even try.

